  name: ssdeep
comment: |-
  Potential Soundness Issues:
  * contains `no_mangle` functions `fuzzyhash` and `fuzzyhash_compare`, these are not gated behind a feature flag
  * uses `unsafe` excessivly when safe functions would work, for example using `Vec::set_len` instead of truncate
  * does not include SAFETY comments
  Code Quality Issues:
  * implements deprecated methods of std::error::Error trait, specifically `description` and `cause`
  * `Error::to_string` does not expose the same info as `Error::description`
  * Modes enum is not marked non_exhaustive (semver hazard)
  * Modes other than None is are implemented
  * Modes should be a set of bitflags instead of an enum, as it should be possible to set both flags at once
  * uses a zero-filled vec, a seperate position variable, and Vec::set_len, instead of Vec::with_capacity and Vec::push
  * does not integrate with any existing hasher traits
  Performance Issues:
  * always returns base64 encoded strings instead of raw bytes
  * Roll::window could use an array instead of a vec, as its length is constant
